  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760240,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1945 I & II - PlayStation 2\n\nRelive the intensity of World War II aerial combat with *1945 I & II*, a thrilling collection bringing both classic shoot 'em ups to the PlayStation 2. Originally arcade hits, these games immerse you in the Pacific Theater, battling against the might of the Japanese Imperial Navy. \n\n*1945 I* puts you in the cockpit of a P-51 Mustang, tasked with liberating islands and destroying enemy strongholds. *1945 II* expands the conflict, featuring multiple playable aircraft – including a B-17 bomber – and a wider range of challenging missions. \n\nExperience fast-paced, vertically scrolling gameplay packed with relentless enemy waves, powerful bosses, and stunning pixel art visuals. Chain together combos, collect power-ups to enhance your firepower, and master the intricate patterns of enemy attacks.  This collection boasts enhanced graphics, a dynamic soundtrack, and a nostalgic trip back to the golden age of arcade shooters. Prepare for a relentless and rewarding test of skill!"
    },
